+# Working on Daylight
+
+**D77 Milestone 1 complete (October 27, 2026):** [Semantic inventory/contract r9](docs/data/l03-ma-benefits-2026-10-25/semantic-inventory-r9/REVIEW.md) freezes 143,505 required source-scoped claims and 249,065 required condition predicates (392,570 total) for the exact 72 L02 build-r5 offerings. Carrier passage bundles are classified/decomposed with exact quotation/parent lineage; CMS schedules/questions, scoped aliases, explicit missing predicates, technical/context retention and the complete-meaning comparison/progress guards are sealed. These are finite evidence/comparison obligations, not counts of unique consumer benefits or verified facts. Every new evidence entry remains unaccepted; full L03 still requires the complete whole-offering pilot, structured comparisons, independent review and exact new-release acceptance. Preserve r9 and the accepted 535-entry r4 reference plus all earlier sealed evidence/code. Changes require a new revision, exact before/after inventory accounting and applicable review; do not silently change the denominator or infer an MVP exemption. See the named gaps, owner/action/closure policies and 153 historical hold groups in the r9 packet.
