+
+Before changing the app, read `PRODUCT.md`, `DAYLIGHT_REQUIREMENTS.md`, `DESIGN.md`, and `docs/product/MASTER_DESIGN.md` with its branching nodes/wireframes/acceptance contract. The latter is the running list of binding owner requirements. New explicit owner instructions take precedence; record them there rather than silently changing direction.
