+
+**D87 next local increment · November 2 · operator tools and evidence preparation.** The new literal drug-name lookup feeds an explicitly selected, report-bound identity service; the provider lookup preserves separate entities, roles and sites. Neither is connected to the customer HTTP/UI or AI tool path. The [r11 whole-offering packet](../../docs/data/l03-ma-benefits-2026-11-01-whole-offering-r11/README.md) captures all H5652-002 source links and prepares 217 additional inpatient obligations. All 4,675 offering obligations retain their original pending/missing states. **The 474-test comparison snapshot passed**; final isolated identity checks, actual reads, later concurrent chat edits/rechecks and technical-review limits are recorded [separately](../../audit-evidence/comparison-next-20261101/README.md). This increment makes no runtime change. The full 1–5 program and personal recommendation release remain unfinished.
+
