+
+**Direct AI Send:** Per owner instruction, the extra confirmation dialog is removed. Deliberate message submission grants the current scoped AI permission; a brief inline disclosure and privacy details explain OpenAI transfer. Typing and navigation make no AI request, and optional/sensitive saving remains separate. Historical modal instructions below are superseded only in this respect.
+
+**Retained human interaction:** :8891's gradual greeting, assistant replies and teaching-text reveal are restored with slower bounded timing, the complete opening sequence, accessible/reduced-motion text and no replay of old messages. The [interaction contract](INTERACTION_CONTRACT.md) is required reading for future changes; normal Python tests include frontend behavior cases. [Restoration evidence](../../audit-evidence/advisor-text-reveal-20261030/README.md). This presentation change spends no AI credits and preserves the current conversation logic/layout.
+
+**Live conversation follow-up:** After the owner restored provider credits, the retirement/birthday, spouse-job coverage and Part B pause cases were checked with the real model. A modal “may” / month “May” grounding false positive was fixed locally. The targeted follow-up passed; 192 free regression tests pass, and total live generation estimates were about six cents. [Exact results and remaining context limits](../../audit-evidence/natural-advisor-live-credits-20261030/README.md).
+
+**Current test allowance: $5 per UTC day.** The owner authorized this increase from $1. A local budget adapter applies the fixed reviewed policy to :8893 while counting all prior shared-ledger spending and holds. The pinned engine and :8890/:8891 retain their stricter policies. This allowance does not replenish API provider credits. [Policy and checks](../../audit-evidence/advisor-budget-5usd-20261030/README.md).
+
+**Current natural conversation flow:** The owner authorized the [natural advisor plan](../../docs/product/NATURAL_ADVISOR_FLOW_PLAN_2026-10-30.md). `natural_flow.py` resolves explicit reports directly, holds actual uncertainty and supplies eligible moves to `natural_agent.py` for a generated acknowledgment and follow-up. Routine typed and form reports no longer need an acceptance card. `natural_state.py` preserves honest reported status, original-record compatibility and permissioned context. The existing optional profile utility and separate preparation authorization remain. The new AI notice covers relevant prior details only after `natural-context-v1` permission; old consent alone retains the narrower context. The layout/styles are unchanged. [Verification and limits](../../audit-evidence/natural-advisor-flow-20261030/README.md).
+
+**Situation-reasoning correction:** The owner authorized fixing the unrelated teaching and unsupported coverage inferences. The local `narrative_agent.py` replaces incidental-word retrieval and supplies the full public 41-question wording/purpose/dependency context. `situation.py` distinguishes explicit work status and an age-65 month/year observation from insurance, desired start and actual enrollment. These two additive reported fields supplement the unchanged original 78 paths and add no required question. They require the existing separate sensitive-save permission; earlier sensitive values and raw history remain excluded from model context. See [the regression/live evaluation packet](../../audit-evidence/advisor-reasoning-fix-20261030/README.md) and `model-policy.json` for actual checks and the bounded reasoning setting. The restored layout is preserved.
