+      "unknown_conflict_handling": "Unknown/deferred never defaults to Original Medicare. Help selection, educational exposure or having a Medicare card establishes no current arrangement; I'm still not sure remains valid after help, without a forced quiz/retry. A/B status or a carrier name alone does not establish delivery. Preserve current and proposed/pending future facts independently; A change is pending alone supplies no current arrangement or effective date, and an application is not an effective switch. Do not treat mere A/B plus Advantage mentions as a same-period conflict without a consequential delivery contradiction. Clarify only genuine ambiguity; keep prior reports inspectable. The single choice cannot fully encode current arrangement plus pending destination/period: retain the supported report/explicit gap, never overwrite known current coverage with Pending.",
+      "source_data_layer": "Existing customer-profile report/confirmation provenance; L13 enrollment/coordination. Official enrollment/administrator notices and reviewed rule versions are separate from a user report. This describes required evidence, not independent acceptance. Exact current policy/period verification is the separate G04 binding/evidence requirement; L11 applies only to requested Medigap consequences. General help uses Medicare.gov coverage/card/account guidance checked October 26, not evidence of this person's enrollment or new L03 acceptance. A plan catalog match proves no enrollment.",
