+      "trigger": "The requested timing/gap/transition check needs the identified insurance's end date, still missing/partial/ambiguous/conflicting after reuse. Confirm which insurance/coverage basis is ending when unclear before asking a date. Name the actual insurance; ask only missing precision. RC11.C1 is the same fact, never an extra ask after the parent or RC08 supplied it.",
+      "acceptable_evidence_or_confirmation": "Explicit coverage-end date or minimal benefits-administrator/notice summary tied to beneficiary, actual policy, current-employment versus COBRA/retiree basis, period/date meaning, precision and actual/scheduled/estimated status. Reuse same-policy/date-type RC08 or chat reports. No plan numbers/full notice are required solely to report dates.",
