+**Proposed treatment:** Internal missing-consequence check within the relevant coverage-change conversation. Trigger only with known group-related benefits, a concrete contemplated change and a requested conclusion that needs the unknown consequence. Reuse an already reported administrator confirmation. No general household interview, blanket instruction to call HR or automatic RC12-to-RC13 step. Where necessary, explain the immediate purpose before asking, offer help and keep unknown/defer available. The wording proposal includes effects on the beneficiary's own group/retiree benefits as well as others, rather than silently treating no dependents as proof of no consequence.
