+**Zero-ask flow:** T07 already provides and confirms the current exact product and relevant attributes. Reuse it, skip RC22 entirely and proceed to actual plan/year evidence. Do not ask optional brand preference, or RC23 fill details merely to complete the template. If exact-product evidence is unavailable after sufficient identity is known, state that limitation and continue other supported work. Unknown identity blocks only that item's dependent exact check and an all-requested-medicines-complete claim; no unchanged-unknown loop.
