+# Daylight project hub
+
+**Current product source handoff · November 2, 2026:** The curated shared baseline includes the current advisor, all 58 pinned engine dependencies, fictional fixtures/tests, infrastructure source and selected project contracts. Use the [development quick start](DEVELOPMENT.md) to prepare exact metadata and launch a fixture without credentials. Research evidence, loaded databases, customer stores and machine launch configuration remain private; some historical evidence links therefore require the separate archive. Fixture proof and code publication do not supply domain or consumer-release acceptance.
