+      "acceptable_evidence_or_confirmation": "Explicit threshold or clear employee-count report for the actual employer/coverage period, or relevant benefits-administrator/materials classification, with entity/period/threshold/provenance. Collect only the category; reuse known reports. Independently accepted direct coordination evidence may supersede a size ask but must not be relabeled as an employee-count answer. Optional conceptual/practical help supplies no fact.",
+      "unknown_conflict_handling": "Unknown/deferred/around threshold is not fewer than 20. Do not infer legal employer size from carrier/brand, office coworkers or number insured. Keep employer size separate from multi-employer-plan qualification; a small employer alone does not resolve a relevant shared-plan exception. Do not apply 20 to disability/ESRD or other inapplicable rules, or silently reuse another threshold's Yes/No semantic binding. Counting definitions/period and conflicts stay explicit; no unchanged-unknown retry.",
